@title Journey: example project to placed, routed and cut-listed cabinet
@area Journeys
# Cabinet workspace steps through the palette: place all, size the enclosure, route, cut list, 3D.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-start
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text place all
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot cabinet-placed
check_layout
check_blank cabinet-placed
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text size enclosure
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot cabinet-sized
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Route all wires
wait 6
key Enter
wait 40
shot cabinet-routed
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text Rail and duct cut list
wait 6
key Enter
wait 30
shot cabinet-cutlist
check_layout
click_text 3D
wait 40
shot cabinet-3d
check_blank cabinet-3d
check_layout
